    {
      "number": "88",
      "source_number": "88",
      "group": null,
      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "88. 确定下列方程的次数：а) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；　б) $5x-6y-14=0$；в) $x^3-5x^2y^4+y^5-8y^3=0$；г) $x^2-5x^3y+y^4-1=0$；д) $x-xy=65$；　е) $x^4-8x^2y^3+y^4=16$；ж) $3xy=x(y+1)-5y$；з) $7x^8-12xy+y=7x^2(x^6+1)$.",
      "lines": [
        "88. 确定下列方程的次数：",
