      "source_number": "89",
      "group": null,
      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "89. 下列变量取值数对是方程$x^2-y+2=0$的解吗？а) $x=1$，$y=3$；　б) $x=0$，$y=0$；в) $x=-2$，$y=2$；　г) $x=-1$，$y=-3$.",
      "lines": [
